OL,3,GNEWSASuspected counterfeit toys seized
OL,4,Aat Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrading Standards officers have seized
OL,7,Fsuspected counterfeit toys worth an
OL,8,Festimated #10,000 from stalls at Hull
OL,9,FFair.
OL,11,FThe items, which were being sold or
OL,12,Foffered as prizes at the fair on Walton
OL,13,FStreet, included large quantities of
OL,14,Fsensory toys, also known as squishy
OL,15,Fdumplings, and plush toys.
OL,17,FOfficers believe some of the products
OL,18,Fcould pose serious safety risks,
OL,19,Fincluding exposure to potentially
OL,20,Fcancer-causing chemicals and may not
OL,21,Fmeet UK safety standards.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
