OL,3,GNEWSASuspected counterfeit toys seized
OL,4,Aat Hull Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Ted Dolman, from Hull City
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "We want to make sure
OL,8,Fthe toys kids play with are safe and
OL,9,Fremain safe".
